<html>
<style type="text/css">
    body {
        background: #ededed;
    }

    .container {
        margin: 10px auto;
        width: 600px;
    }

    /*-- Email CSS --*/

    .mexemeailtheme {
        background-color: #fff;
        font-family: Arial;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeailhead {
        background-color: #328081;
        padding: 3px 5px 5px 5px;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeaillogo {
        padding-left: 35px;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeaillogo p {
        font-family: Arial;
        font-weight: 400;
        font-size: 22px;
        color: #fff;
    }

    .mexemeaillogo p>sup {
        font-size: 15px;
    }

    .mexemeailphoto {
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeailphoto img {
        max-width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeailcontent {
        background-color: #fff;
        padding: 10px 30px;
        overflow: hidden;
        color: #5e5e5e;
        width: 90%;
    }

    .mexemeailcontent p {
        line-height: 26px;
        font-size: 18px;
        color: #5e5e5e;
    }

    .mexemeailbut {
        background-color: #cf614d;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 15px 35px;
        border-radius: 30px;
        width: max-content;
        margin: 10px 0px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 18px;
        display: block;
        color: #fff;
    }

    .mexemeailbut:hover,
    .mexemeailbut:focus {
        opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .mexemeailsocial {
        padding: 15px 35px 35px 35px;
        background-color: #ebf3f3;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeailsocial h3 {
        color: #5e5e5e;
    }

    .mexemico {
        background-size: 100% !important;
        margin-right: 10px;
        overflow: hidden;
        display: block;
        float: left;
    }

    .mexemico:hover,
    .mexemico:focus {
        opacity: 0.8;
    }

    /*.mexemailfaceboock{
                    background:url(https://www.mexinsurance.com/wp-content/uploads/emailfaceboock.png) no-repeat;
                }
                
                .mexemailinstagram{
                    background:url(https://www.mexinsurance.com/wp-content/uploads/emailinstagram.png) no-repeat;
                }
                
                .mexemailtweeter{
                    background:url(https://www.mexinsurance.com/wp-content/uploads/emailtweeter.png) no-repeat;
                }*/

    .mexemeailfooter {
        background-color: #328081;
        padding: 25px 35px;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeailfooter p {
        line-height: 26px;
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #bcd5d5;
    }

    .mexemeailfooter p>a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    .mexemeailfooter p>a:hover,
    .mexemeailfooter p>a:focus {
        opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .mexemeailfooter a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    .mexemeailfooter a:hover,
    .mexemeailfooter a:focus {
        opacity: 0.9;
    }
</style>

<body>
    <div style="background-color:#fff;font-family:Arial;overflow:hidden;width:100%;">

        <div style="display:flex; background-color:#fff; padding:8px 0;text-align: -webkit-center; ">
            <p style="margin:Auto;">
<img src="https://www.mexinsurance.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-Logo-1-2048x312.png" alt="i_logo"   width="225" /> 
</p>
        </div>

        <p>Dear  {USERNAME_FIELD},</p>

        <p>Due to oversight or duplicate email in our system, your account was not adequately activated when we migrated to the new system.  This means you would have had to call us to gain access to your insurance documents.  I truly regret the error, which has been corrected.  Please expect a "Welcome" email from me, which will provide you a path to set your password in the new system and gain access to the world-class Mexican insurance system by MexInsurance®.</p>

   <p>If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us at <a href="tel:8586636453">858-663-6453</a> or reply to this email.</p>
        <p>
            Thank you.
        </p>
        <p>
            Respectfully,<br />
            Charles
        </p>


        <div style="background-color:#fff;padding:18px 0;overflow:hidden;width:100%;" class="mexemeailfooter">
            <div style="display:flex;">
                <p style="margin:Auto;"><img
                        src="https://www.mexinsurance.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-Logo-1-2048x312.png"
                        width="175" /></p>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex">
                <p style="margin:Auto;color:#000; padding-top: 20px; font-size: 14px;">&copy; MEXICO INSURANCE SERVICES,
                    INC.</p>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex">
                <p style="margin:Auto;color:#000; padding-top: 6px; font-size: 14px;">CALIFORNIA INSURANCE LICENSE:
                    0G35864</p>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex">
                <p style="margin:Auto;color:#000; font-size: 11px; padding-top: 4px;"><a
                        style="text-decoration:none;color:#000;" target="_blank"
                        href="https://www.mexinsurance.com/">MEXINSURANCE.COM</a></p>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex">
                <p style="margin:Auto;color:#000; font-size: 11px; padding-top: 4px;">T. 855 MEXICO.5</p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>